                                "sense_id": "30fee1a5-f835-30ba-8488-a1c03e4281e2",
                                "text": "De verkoper was tevreden met de behaalde verkoopprijs van zijn antieke meubels.",
                                "translation": "The seller was satisfied with the achieved bidding price of his antique furniture.",
